This product re-implements trading strategies from "quant-trading" by je-suis-tm
(https://github.com/je-suis-tm/quant-trading), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
Strategy logic was ported and modified: look-ahead bias was removed and price-unit
thresholds were rescaled to percentages. See docs/methodology.md for every change.

Market data is downloaded at run time from third-party datasets and is not distributed
with this repository:
  - github.com/Johnbrick123/sp500-data
  - github.com/finom/static-klines (Binance klines)
  - github.com/axb0306/cme-futures-ohlc
